  ('dd8ed404-cfb9-4ae9-85e6-797acb0d0329', 'c96d6913-e264-4c7e-a7bc-e1277258ed5f', 'geo-o01', 'The Distance Between Centers: I kept getting the wrong numerator and finally found my bug. I computed $4K$ as $4 \cdot 84 = 326$ (??).

