  ('a8f6769b-ade4-4372-951f-8322b3be9424', '09ada1f5-8f2d-4285-8a0e-995131237a37', 'comb-f01', 'Breakdown for Digit Sets and Permutations (four-digit numbers, distinct digits, digit sum divisible by 9).

