  ('066cf817-76d6-481a-a916-d1e5fe93af6b', '1c280e41-7d6b-41cf-89cd-875fef6b9c23', 'comb-a01', 'Two Forbidden Adjacencies: my first answer was 2160 because I forgot to add back the intersection 🤦

