  ('523f5586-5586-49b1-98da-36ca121dcadc', '66948fc8-d6fb-493d-a7c8-8ba54e68b80a', 'gen-aime-com-019', 'Distinct digits, one residue (Advanced, 5 digits): 9072. Sharing a tidy way to organize it.

