  ('68bfa816-dc07-4cfa-80c3-5db64976c002', 'ee6b31a1-d01d-4726-9faa-757e43fdaa36', 'gen-usamo-alg-001', 'Nesbitt''s inequality: how many proofs can we collect? I''ll start.

