  ('16766b1f-5eb6-4c84-af44-55ff292b862b', '5fa2836a-8aa6-469d-b884-263ee9e73af5', 'gen-usamo-alg-007', 'A quadratic form: find all $k$ with $a^2 + b^2 + c^2 + k(ab + bc + ca) \ge 0$ for all reals $a, b, c$.

