  ('bd07b684-c3ec-46e4-b6a1-f9c16e3a2292', 'c2d4d6e6-fd32-42dd-aea2-857d55072a5c', 'gen-usamo-com-015', 'Monochromatic triangle in $K_6$, my proof for feedback:

